msgstr "这将断开本设备与 Tailnet 的连接，并且需要重新进行身份验证。"

msgid "UDP port for the Peer Relay service (--peer-relay-port). Open this port on your router firewall/NAT."
msgstr "节点中继服务的 UDP 端口 (--peer-relay-port)。请确保在路由器防火墙中放行此端口。"

msgid "Unknown error"
msgstr "未知错误"

msgid "Use OpenWrt system firewall to manage NAT for Tailscale tunnel and subnet traffic. Disabling this option disables source address masquerading to preserve real source IPs of remote peers and subnets in the local network."
msgstr "由 OpenWrt 系统防火墙统一接管 Tailscale 隧道及对端子网流量的地址转换。禁用此项将禁用源地址伪装，在局域网中保留对端节点和子网的真实源 IP。"

msgid "Version"
